<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσό-θεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal to the gods,
			godlike</i>, of heroes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. φώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.565
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.324
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				80
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρεῖος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				857
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				837
			</span></i> (anap.); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος</span></b> 
			
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				626
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				255a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.5
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητρὸς φιλόσοφος ἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Decent.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			: Com., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομίσαι τ᾽ ἰσόθεον τὴν ἔγχελυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					147.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. τυραννίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1169
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.145
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσοδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					165
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Mon.</u>
					378
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.10.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).432.4
			</span></i> (Megalop.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					666.21
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); freq. of medicines or remedies, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				279
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.11
			</span></i>: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θεον</span> as
			Adv., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				2.220
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑσ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> and Trag. (always lyr.); hyperaeol. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσσο-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					647.15
				</span></i>
			 (Cyme, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).]</div>
